From 0b9041aef66f0645c09a11226faa24cd366e8fd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MedSphere Agent <agent@medsphere.local>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 07:22:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(auth): real phone OTP verification + SMS provider
 boundary (ADR-023)

- add PhoneOtpChallenge (hashed code, expiry, attempts, consumption)
- add SMS_OTP to AccountVerificationProvider, new otp.requested audit event
- extract shared activation-eligibility logic in AccountVerificationService
  (behavior-preserving) and add applyPhoneVerified() for the OTP path
- add PhoneOtpService: request/verify with cooldown, attempt limits,
  expiry, idempotent replay, non-enumerating responses
- add fail-closed SMS provider activation boundary mirroring ADR-021's
  EMAIL contract; no vendor selected or activated
- wire AUTH_OTP_PEPPER through config, CI workflows, compose, .env.example
- add two account-scoped Redis-backed throttlers (otp-request, otp-verify)
- add controller endpoints, DTOs, module wiring
- add ADR-023 and unit tests for crypto/normalization/SMS contract
